      "message": "\u003e Do you prefer to keep it damaged?\n\nYes, why not? `overlay_buf` goes out of scope right after anyway.\n\nMy comment was only about `from_custom_debug_overlay_policy` and `from_overlay_onto_new_fdt` so not sure why pvmfw changes would be required?",
