      "writtenOn": "2023-09-27T15:37:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In path `/node@overlay/__overlay__`, `node@overlay` will be dropped when applying overlay so manufacturers can change it with any arbitrary string.\n\nIn order to find right node, we should travel DT while understanding overlay syntax, but it doesn\u0027t look like a trivial change here.",
